HiSearch

This source release derives from GrepSeek:
https://github.com/alirezasalemi7/grepseek
The original authors' notices and Apache License 2.0 are retained.
The upstream citation metadata is preserved in docs/GrepSeek.CITATION.cff.

HiSearch additions include hybrid dense/shell retrieval and candidate scopes,
multi-trajectory SFT, and maintained five-criterion rubric rewards for GSPO.
Existing source files also contain local training, tool, and checkpoint fixes.
See docs/PROVENANCE.md and verl/VENDORED.md for provenance and modifications.

The vendored verl runtime retains its own LICENSE and Notice.txt:
Copyright 2023-2024 Bytedance Ltd. and/or its affiliates

The optional Search-R1 encoder is an external dependency and is not vendored.
Model weights, datasets, and indexes are not included in this source release.
